From f625a8d087ed58fc136ecbde89838a709bad527c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:14:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] util, vulkan: support the PS4's libc and FreeBSD 9
 kernel

- futex: FreeBSD 9's UMTX_OP_WAIT_UINT takes a relative timeout.
- os_file: there is no kinfo_file.
- memstream: there is no open_memstream; use a temporary file, as on
  Windows, and use u_memstream for RADV's hang reports.
- vk_device: the PS4's CLOCK_MONOTONIC_FAST is too coarse for the raw
  time domain.
- radv: don't crash on pipeline representations that could not be
  captured.

Co-authored-by: Mihawk <163614687+mihawk-99@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
